@Kong_HostAddress = http://20.88.187.29:8000
@Localhost = http://localhost:5025

### Principais operações da API de catálogo de jogos
### 1. Autenticar e obter token
# @name login
POST {{Kong_HostAddress}}/user/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@fiapcloud.com.br",
  "password": "admin"
}

###

### 2. Cadastrar um novo jogo
POST {{Kong_HostAddress}}/game/
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Resident Evil 5000",
  "genres": [{"name": "ACTION"}],
  "description": "A new Resident Evil Series game",
  "publisher": "Capcom",
  "releaseDate": "2026-02-27T00:00:00Z",
  "price": 70
}
###

### 3. Adicionar um jogo ao catálogo de um usuário
POST {{Kong_HostAddress}}/catalog/
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "gameId": "6ac43cd7c434256484799e1d",
  "userEmail": "usuario.teste@fiap.com",
  "price": 49.99
}
###

### 4. Consultar jogos no catalogo do usuário
GET {{Kong_HostAddress}}/catalog/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Demais operações:

### Obter todos os jogos
GET {{Kong_HostAddress}}/game/
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Accept: application/json
###

### Obter um jogo específico
GET {{Kong_HostAddress}}/game/6acd8f85bb788882ed0258be
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Accept: application/json
###

### Atualizar um jogo existente
PUT {{Kong_HostAddress}}/game/6aa1f120ba223ae8fbdad74c
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Resident Evil X",
  "genre": "Action",
  "description": "A new Resident Evil Series game",
  "publisher": "Capcom",
  "releaseDate": "2026-02-27T00:00:00Z",
  "price": 70,
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}
###

### Remover um jogo
DELETE {{Kong_HostAddress}}/game/6a84f2a42821cd3184ebc821
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Accept: application/json
###

### Buscar jogos no Elasticsearch
GET {{Kong_HostAddress}}/game/search?q=Resident
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Accept: application/json
###